  "ingredients": [
    "24 OREO Cookies, divided",
    "3 tablespoons butter, melted",
    "3 (250 g) packages PHILADELPHIA Brick Cream Cheese, softened",
    "0.75 cup sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla",
    "3 large eggs"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/51Xc5HSWzNCAC4O0iUTp-jq1VGM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180603-easy-philly-oreo-cheesecake-DDMFS-Step-01-155c7f5652124b9d956fdc7b54ed0e17.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180603/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 16 cookies in a resealable plastic bag. Flatten bag to remove excess air, then seal bag. Finely crush cookies by rolling a rolling pin across the bag.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FWMZ_I7cc5lJWYXaJPfVYlUCOWE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180603-easy-philly-oreo-cheesecake-DDMFS-Step-02-08f795426e394cafa77623dbfff3a48d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180603/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place crushed cookies in a bowl. Add melted butter; mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IZjSiXqJIZTtt0-MARZ98oNuCrs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180603-easy-philly-oreo-cheesecake-DDMFS-Step-03-d5a0761491f34b0db79a237a36a73d0a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180603/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press mixture firmly onto bottom of a 9-inch springform pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bFuCtMV8CI9dD8ISffuJFHB5qz0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180603-easy-philly-oreo-cheesecake-DDMFS-Step-04-3b4fed5ecc5e4b70af95eb01a7b0d467.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180603/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat cream cheese, sugar, and vanilla in a large bowl with an electric mixer on medium speed until well-blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZNF622hk0oSh0uy7i9lEGk0cNVQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180603-easy-philly-oreo-cheesecake-DDMFS-Step-05-9ad84f9af3c34cd4b847059ce6093e0a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180603/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in eggs, 1 at a time, until just blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/icJWkRQiLZ8_XErMt3xJ5o6LCSU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180603-easy-philly-oreo-cheesecake-DDMFS-Step-06-67c4de5cd4074c5b8b884902238aedb2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180603/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chop remaining 8 cookies; gently stir 1/2 of the chopped cookies into cream cheese batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XMbQMZLEh8O9mCrtOhOqvqs1KI8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180603-easy-philly-oreo-cheesecake-DDMFS-Step-07-4cef434c8ce94ca68ca5becdfcc12610.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180603/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour over prepared crust; sprinkle remaining chopped cookies on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HpIIRFzPoTwFDl-NQPn2OfLnqUc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180603-easy-philly-oreo-cheesecake-DDMFS-Step-08-d9552beb203f49d6957d794b424d176e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180603/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until center is just set, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xpgi2lI-8dbQAhBR2MU-FK-flIY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180603-easy-philly-oreo-cheesecake-DDMFS-Step-9-9100da8ca86d4089a4a46fb1be31e820.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180603/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Refrigerate for 3 hours to overnight. Cut cheesecake into 12 equal pieces; store leftovers in the refrigerator.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/20cc7seWyl4dr38TEFmkJv9Wbxo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180603-easy-philly-oreo-cheesecake-DDMFS-Step-10-d2410a93a7964d8599b10c3828607261.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180603/step_10.webp"
    }
  ],
